---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Hoshiworks – Custom workflow automation solutions">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-center">
      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <img
          src="/brand/hoshiworks-logo-1.0.png"
          alt="Hoshiworks"
          class="h-14 sm:h-20 w-auto"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Keep the original text color asset available (hidden, for future reuse) -->
      <p class="hidden text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sky-300/80">
        Hoshiworks
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
        Custom workflow automation solutions
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Your time is valuable. I’m here to free you from the boring and repetitive parts of your work
        by transforming them into simple and efficient workflow automations.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a
          href="#intake"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium bg-sky-400 text-slate-950 hover:bg-sky-300 transition"
        >
          Start a project
        </a>

        <a
          href="#how-it-works"
          class="text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-100"
        >
          See how it works →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Prime automation candidates -->
  <section id="services" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          What can Hoshiworks can do for your team?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Take the parts of your work that nobody wants to do, and make them the parts that nobody has to do.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Intake and onboarding</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Turn “Can you fill this out?” into a clean pipeline: intake form, auto-confirmation,
            auto-folder creation, task list, and a first scheduled call.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Common wins: client onboarding, volunteer onboarding, new-hire setup.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Reports and reminders</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Automate recurring status updates, weekly summaries, “nobody replied” follow-ups,
            and deadline nudges so the system remembers for you.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Common wins: weekly KPI emails, board packets, grant deadlines, renewal reminders.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Data cleanup and handoff</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Reduce copy-paste and broken spreadsheets by syncing data between the tools you already use,
            validating it, and creating clean handoffs between people.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Common wins: CRM to sheets, form to invoice, email to ticket, dedupe and validation.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

 <!-- How it works -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          What is the Hoshiworks process?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Every project has three simple steps, and one tangible outcome.
          You bring the messy work; I bring structure through automation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 1
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">You tell me about your work</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            In two short conversations we will map your workflow, tools, and failure points,
            and which parts of your work are worth automating.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 2
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">I build something that helps</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            In 1–2 weeks, I build a meaningful automation or internal tool of your choice
            that removes a specific recurring headache from your team’s week.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 3
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">We keep it running smoothly</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Two scheduled check-ups and light ongoing support keeps your workflows healthy
            as your tools, team, and data change over time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why -->
  <section id="why" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          Why Hoshiworks instead of another automation shop?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          My goal isn’t to sell you a particular product.
          It’s to make your work less brittle, more humane, and easier to manage as your organization grows and evolves
          by using the most appropriate, effective, and affordable tools available.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Small-team focused</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            I prefer to build for nonprofits, studios, and small businesses where process lives in a few brains and
            a lot of spreadsheets, where manpower is limited and my workflows can make the most difference.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Human-centered processes</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            My workflows are designed around how people actually communicate and decide things,
            not just what your tools can technically do.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Deliberately limited scope</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Clear boundaries, no hype. Each project is scoped to one narrow but tangible improvement for your business,
            not a fantasy platform your team will never maintain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intake placeholder -->
  <section id="intake" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Start a project</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        The automated onboarding flow is coming next. For now, email me and I’ll reply with a short intake link.
      </p>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@hoshiworks.dev"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium border border-slate-700 text-slate-100 hover:border-slate-500 transition"
        >
          Email: hello@hoshiworks.dev
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="px-6 py-10 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Hoshiworks. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="hover:text-slate-200">How it works</a>
        <a href="#services" class="hover:text-slate-200">Examples</a>
        <a href="#intake" class="hover:text-slate-200">Start a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
